{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/20/itm_dc3dfdd3b0a12cd3/index.md","canonical_url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/fairstress","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-21T16:39:30Z","content_hash":"c65f854dd9b1cf8ed55a030515180680a21bbd72ca6aac5644cab7d87d55ce7b","evidence":[{"label":"Ai2 official announcement","type":"url","url":"https://allenai.org/blog/fairstress"},{"label":"Full technical report","type":"url","url":"https://allenai.org/papers/fairstress"},{"label":"Open dataset","type":"url","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/fairstress"},{"label":"Open evaluation code","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/pardissz/fairstress"}],"external_id":"allenai/fairstress","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T16:39:30Z","fingerprint":"c65f854dd9b1cf8ed55a030515180680a21bbd72ca6aac5644cab7d87d55ce7b","id":"itm_dc3dfdd3b0a12cd3","item_id":"itm_dc3dfdd3b0a12cd3","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-20T00:00:00Z","reading_minutes":24,"sort_at":"2026-10-20T00:00:00Z","source_id":"ai2-fairstress","source_name":"Ai2 FairStress","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"FairStress 是 Ai2 面向高风险双候选决策的公平评测：它用 300 个场景、29 个领域、四级身份线索、33 种群体配对和 78 条镜像对抗前缀，将答案、抗压翻转、理由和激活分层审计，完整空间达 13,032,104 项，另有 50,012 项 IRT Core 集。15 个模型在显式身份条件下的准确率差仅 2.9 点，但放弃正确答案的鲁棒性差为 9.3 点、平局翻转差为 23.9 点；九种事后去偏大多不稳定，反事实 CoT 虽可缩小鲁棒性差仍保留平局倾斜。该结论依赖 equality 基线与合成短题；训练数据审计只提供 OLMo-3 的相关性而非因果证明。","tags":["ai-safety","fairness","llm-evaluation","robustness","alignment"],"title":"FairStress: A deeper evaluation of fairness in LLM decision-making","title_hash":"d21bf3cd287b09c4302cf770fbd6da0fd6656b9d3192d75cc5681b8d61c8422a","type":"report","url":"https://allenai.org/blog/fairstress"}
